 class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes, or would you rather go back to playing Candy Crush? The battle awaits you in <strong>Army Moves Overdrive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295100/extras/9ea8a120e48f298fb814bacb00c69e78.poster.avif?t=1750972033\" width=640 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295100/extras/9ea8a120e48f298fb814bacb00c69e78.webm?t=1750972033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295100/extras/9ea8a120e48f298fb814bacb00c69e78.mp4?t=1750972033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
